    {
      "entryId": "num-21-11",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The itinerary continues toward Moab, toward the sunrising. First principle: even Israel's marching orders are recorded; the itinerary itineraries are the road-map the Lord Jesus walked in type.",
